 "description": "List the user's own Xenition ledger invoices with paid/unpaid status. Optionally filter to a vendor or only unpaid ones. Use ONLY when the user is asking to see or total invoices already recorded in their Xenition ledger \u2014 e.g. 'what invoices are unpaid', 'how much do I owe vendor X'. Do NOT use it to send, text, email, or deliver an invoice to anyone (Xenition cannot send communications), and do NOT use it to look up invoices that are not in the user's Xenition ledger.",
